🧪 TESTING RULES
Write Widget Tests for UIs

Write Unit Tests for Business Logic

Use Golden Tests for Layout Consistency

Test Responsiveness on Real Devices + Emulators

🤖 CHAT AGENT RULES (WHEN USING CLAUDE OR CHATGPT)
Be Explicit with Prompts

Example: “Give me a reusable Flutter form field with validation and responsive width.”

Request Explanation with Code

Helps in learning and catching mistakes.

Review and Refactor Suggested Code

Don’t blindly copy-paste—verify it fits your architecture and logic.

Ask for Optimized Versions

Ask: “Can you make this more efficient?” or “Can this be made more reusable?”